<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "立木三日大" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "タイトル鈴.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<TXSPN>From now on, when I come, I will sound this tone.<PG>
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Now, allow me to introduce myself properly. 
{PAUSE ""}
I serve as the guide of this world, and my name is <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="みか">Mika</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="たちき">Tachiki</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Welcome, and thank you for coming.<PG>
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
That you have taken an interest in this world gratifies me beyond measure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Your visit, I welcome from the bottom of my heart.<PG>
For reasons of circumstance I cannot show you my face, but I will say, for what it is worth, only that I am a woman.<PG>
I am sorry to trouble you, but would you tell me your name?<PG>
{MESOFF "-1"}
{DELETECG "プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
